{"unit_id":"534119219__chicheng-push#card-zh","repo":"534119219/chicheng-push","commit":"2aa2b8273183bc91f4cf6d12b1f7121bbee751da","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"chicheng-push 是一款面向 DSH Web 的消息推送插件，在设置侧栏提供渠道管理面板，并注册 pushNotifier 服务和 /push/api HTTP 接口供其他插件或调用方发送通知。用户可以配置多个 Server酱、PushPlus、Bark、钉钉、企业微信、Telegram、飞书、ntfy、PushDeer、Gotify、自定义 Webhook 或邮件渠道，分别启用、测试、编辑和删除；发送时可选择启用渠道并查看逐项结果。它适合希望把任务完成消息或其他 DSH 事件送到常用消息平台的用户。邮件渠道需环境能够加载 nodemailer。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:529-543","lib/index.js:888-935","lib/index.js:303-317","lib/index.js:520-580"]}
{"unit_id":"534119219__chicheng-push#card-en","repo":"534119219/chicheng-push","commit":"2aa2b8273183bc91f4cf6d12b1f7121bbee751da","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"chicheng-push adds a notification panel to DSH Web and exposes a service and HTTP API for sending messages. Configure and manage channels such as Telegram, Feishu, Bark, custom webhooks, and email, then send to selected enabled channels and review per-channel results. Email requires nodemailer.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:529-543","lib/index.js:888-935","lib/index.js:303-317","lib/index.js:520-580"]}
